1
00:00:04,640 --> 00:00:06,670
我们昨晚在铁板烧店碰见你妈了
Oh, hey, we ran into your mom at Benihana last night.

2
00:00:06,670 --> 00:00:08,480
是啊  她超爱去那里
Uh, yeah, she loves that place.

3
00:00:08,480 --> 00:00:10,040
每次大厨把大虾翻炒到空中时
Every time they flip a shrimp in the air,

4
00:00:10,040 --> 00:00:12,900
她会一个飞扑上去叼住
she practically leaps out of her seat to catch it.

5
00:00:13,550 --> 00:00:15,670
所以我从不带她去海洋公园[喂海豚]
That's why I don't take her to the Seaworld.

6
00:00:17,370 --> 00:00:18,700
我知道你不想听到这事
I know you don't want to hear it,

7
00:00:18,700 --> 00:00:20,540
但是她是跟斯图尔特一起去的
but she was there with Stuart.

8
00:00:20,730 --> 00:00:22,780
随便啊  我又无所谓
That's fine. I don't care.

9
00:00:22,780 --> 00:00:24,670
他们出去约会你不会不爽吗
It doesn't bug you when they go out on dates?

10
00:00:24,670 --> 00:00:25,750
他们不是约会
They're not dating.

11
00:00:25,750 --> 00:00:28,650
只是两个朋友一起出去吃饭
They're just two friends who went out to dinner.

12
00:00:28,650 --> 00:00:30,610
吃完一起回他们共住的房子
And then went back to the home they share

13
00:00:30,610 --> 00:00:31,720
没准睡觉时两人还穿着
where they probably fell asleep

14
00:00:31,720 --> 00:00:33,230
你妈妈买的情侣睡衣
in the matching pajamas she got them

15
00:00:33,230 --> 00:00:36,190
因为他们俩都喜欢企鹅
because they both just love penguins.

16
00:00:37,450 --> 00:00:41,040
很多不是情侣的人也穿着情侣睡衣啊
Hey, lots of people wear matching pajamas who aren't dating.

17
00:00:41,040 --> 00:00:42,150
比如说
Like who?

18
00:00:42,150 --> 00:00:44,170
你和你的狗
Like you and your dog.

19
00:00:45,610 --> 00:00:48,830
话别说太早哦
Don't rule out the dating.

20
00:00:48,830 --> 00:00:51,440
行  我心里超不爽
Fine, it bothers me.

21
00:00:51,440 --> 00:00:52,460
你们高兴了吧
You happy?

22
00:00:52,460 --> 00:00:54,520
你这问题算什么啊
You think you've got problems.

23
00:00:54,520 --> 00:00:57,420
长臂猿是人猿总科中
The gibbon is the only member of the ape family

24
00:00:57,420 --> 00:01:00,330
唯一不是大猿的猿类
not classified as a great ape.

25
00:01:02,230 --> 00:01:03,540
你这话对我有啥帮助
How is this helpful?

26
00:01:03,540 --> 00:01:05,590
所有非人类的猩猩
All the non-human apes are classified

27
00:01:05,590 --> 00:01:07,560
全都归在人猿总科下的人科里
as great apes except one.

28
00:01:07,560 --> 00:01:08,430
这就表示
That means

29
00:01:08,430 --> 00:01:11,720
分类学家创造了小猿这个分类
taxonomists created the entire category of lesser ape

30
00:01:11,720 --> 00:01:13,570
来孤立可怜的长臂猿
just to single out the poor gibbon

31
00:01:13,570 --> 00:01:15,990
他就像操场上被排挤的小孩
as the weird kid on the playground.

32
00:01:16,660 --> 00:01:19,940
这些毛茸茸的小伙心中才是真不爽呢
Now there's a hairy little fellow with a genuine beef.

33
00:01:20,680 --> 00:01:23,110
但是长臂猿们不知道自己被分类成什么
But the gibbon doesn't know what it's categorized as.

34
00:01:23,110 --> 00:01:25,260
它们都不知道自己叫长臂猿
It doesn't even know it's called a gibbon.

35
00:01:25,260 --> 00:01:26,520
这倒是
True.

36
00:01:27,090 --> 00:01:29,920
抱歉  兄台  你比长臂猿还惨
Sorry, kid, you've got it worse than a gibbon.

37
00:01:49,750 --> 00:01:51,250
生

38
00:01:49,750 --> 00:01:51,250
活

39
00:01:49,750 --> 00:01:51,250
大

40
00:01:49,750 --> 00:01:51,250
爆

41
