炸

42
00:01:49,750 --> 00:01:51,250
第八季  第八集

43
00:01:59,090 --> 00:02:00,330
电影之夜我们带零食来了
We brought snacks for movie night.

44
00:02:00,330 --> 00:02:01,130
太好了
Oh, great.

45
00:02:01,130 --> 00:02:03,700
你们不会顺便还带了餐巾纸  干净的碗
I don't suppose you also brought napkins, clean bowls,

46
00:02:03,700 --> 00:02:05,720
餐具外加一卷厕纸吧
utensils and a roll of toilet paper.

47
00:02:05,720 --> 00:02:06,460
还真带了
Right here.

48
00:02:08,570 --> 00:02:10,120
你们最好了
You guys are the best.

49
00:02:10,120 --> 00:02:11,390
这些衣服是怎么回事
What's with the clothes?

50
00:02:11,390 --> 00:02:12,920
我为了工作买了不少职业装
Well, with all the new stuff I bought for work,

51
00:02:12,920 --> 00:02:14,890
衣橱得清出一些空位啊
I needed to make room in my closet.

52
00:02:14,890 --> 00:02:16,290
我是问这次衣服怎么是叠好的
I meant why are they folded?

53
00:02:16,290 --> 00:02:17,680
不过随便吧
But whatever.

54
00:02:18,840 --> 00:02:21,340
这件是干嘛的
Ooh, what's this?

55
00:02:21,340 --> 00:02:24,280
说了怕你们不信  那是我当年的毕业舞会裙
That, believe it or not, is my prom dress.

56
00:02:24,280 --> 00:02:26,290
你还留着啊
Wow, you still have it?

57
00:02:26,290 --> 00:02:27,790
我还以为会急忙中被揉成一团
I just assumed it was balled up

58
00:02:27,790 --> 00:02:30,540
丢到谷仓的某个角落去了
in the corner of a barn somewhere.

59
00:02:34,000 --> 00:02:36,230
你把我当年想成是哪种人了啊
What kind of teenager did you think I was?

60
00:02:36,230 --> 00:02:37,840
-淫荡  -风骚
- Slutty. - Easy.

61
00:02:39,530 --> 00:02:42,060
那是叫"受欢迎"好吗
The word is "popular."

62
00:02:43,530 --> 00:02:45,110
你当年的舞会如何  你去了吗
How was your prom? Did you go?

63
00:02:45,110 --> 00:02:46,940
没  但我去打扫了
No, but I was on clean-up crew.

64
00:02:46,940 --> 00:02:48,680
太可怜了
Aw, that's sad.

65
00:02:48,680 --> 00:02:50,010
不会  其实也还行
No, it was okay.

66
00:02:50,010 --> 00:02:52,660
DJ在收工前  让我与我的拖把
The DJ let me dance one slow song with my mop

67
00:02:52,660 --> 00:02:54,530
共舞了一曲慢歌
before he shut down.

68
00:02:55,730 --> 00:02:57,310
每当我看到一桶脏水
Whenever I see a bucket of dirty water,

69
00:02:57,310 --> 00:03:00,310
耳边还会响起那曲《红衣女郎》
I still hear "Lady in Red."

70
00:03:03,220 --> 00:03:05,180
我当年的舞会也挺糟糕
My prom was pretty terrible, too.

71
00:03:05,180 --> 00:03:06,610
当时我超兴奋那个男生来约我
I was so excited about my date,

72
00:03:06,610 --> 00:03:07,820
结果发现他是为了泡我朋友
but it turned out he only asked me

73
00:03:07,820 --> 00:03:09,290
所以才来约我
'cause he liked my friend.

74
00:03:09,290 --> 00:03:11,320
他一整个晚上都在聊我的朋友
He spent the whole night talking about her.

75
00:03:11,320 --> 00:03:13,420
行行行  你有朋友又有人约
Okay, we get it, you had a friend and a date.

76
00:03:13,420 --> 00:03:15,070
少显摆了好吗
Stop bragging.

77
00:03:16,230 --> 00:03:16,940
无所谓啦
Doesn't matter.

78
00:03:16,940 --> 00:03:18,180
毕业舞会蠢爆了
Prom is silly anyways.

79
00:03:18,180 --> 00:03:19,120
你说当然容易
Easy for you to say;

80
00:03:19,120 --> 00:03:21,430
你当年估计是跟橄榄球队队长一起去的
you probably went with the captain of the football team.

81
00:03:21,430 --> 00:03:23,030
才不是
No.

82
00:03:23,200 --> 00:03:24,430
我只是趁他的舞伴喝吐时
I just made out with him a little

83
00:03:24,430 --> 00:03:26,350
偷偷跟他亲热了一番
while his date was puking.

84
00:03:27,400 --> 00:03:30,330
那呕吐物就会是我的舞伴拖把来清理
My date would've had to clean that up.

85
00:03:31,850 --> 00:03:33,220
