你有去毕业舞会吗
Did you go to your prom?

116
00:04:36,300 --> 00:04:37,390
没
No.

117
00:04:37,800 --> 00:04:41,190
因为我与当个好学生有个约会
I had a date with a proper education.

118
00:04:41,810 --> 00:04:45,790
比起一身燕尾服  我养成一身好习惯
Instead of a tuxedo, I dressed myself in good habits.

119
00:04:45,790 --> 00:04:47,120
比起掺了烈酒的潘趣酒
Instead of spiked punch,

120
