Ugh, thanks a lot.

133
00:05:18,010 --> 00:05:18,710
怎么了
What?

134
00:05:18,710 --> 00:05:22,290
要是我说不想参加  不就成了坏女人了吗
Well, now I can't blow this thing off without being a bitch.

135
00:05:22,900 --> 00:05:25,460
所以说她答应了
That sounds like a "Yes"!

136
00:05:28,410 --> 00:05:31,160
每一位受邀的人都回复说参加
Ooh, every single person RSVP'd "Yes."

137
00:05:31,160 --> 00:05:32,910
真是太让人激动了
This is so exciting!

138
00:05:32,910 --> 00:05:35,250
你说是不是呀
Isn't this exciting?

139
00:05:38,610 --> 00:05:39,760
是
Yep.

140
00:05:40,900 --> 00:05:42,630
就连斯尔图特都要带舞伴来
Look, even Stuart's bringing a date.

141
00:05:42,630 --> 00:05:43,710
真好奇那人是谁
I wonder who it is.

142
00:05:43,710 --> 00:05:45,650
你明明知道那人是谁
You know exactly who it is.

143
00:05:45,650 --> 00:05:46,760
我妈就是他的舞伴
He's gonna bring my mom.

144
00:05:46,760 --> 00:05:48,280
你干嘛要邀请他啊
Why did you even invite him?

145
00:05:48,280 --> 00:05:51,170
因为他是我们的朋友  你们俩必须和睦相处
Because he's our friend, and you two need to get along.

146
00:05:51,170 --> 00:05:52,420
再说了  他为什么不能带你妈来
And why can't he take your mom?

147
00:05:52,420 --> 00:05:54,770
你毕业舞会的时候不也带了吗
You took her to your prom.

148
00:05:56,140 --> 00:05:59,050
我没有"带"她去  她是去"监护"我
I didn't "Take" her; she was a chaperone.

149
00:05:59,050 --> 00:06:02,080
我见过一张你们一起跳舞的照片
I saw a picture of you two dancing together.

150
00:06:02,080 --> 00:06:03,230
不能怪我
W-What was I gonna do?

151
00:06:03,230 --> 00:06:05,480
当时在播我们爱的主打歌
They were playing our song!

152
00:06:07,280 --> 00:06:08,970
我受不了了
I can't take this anymore.

153
00:06:12,780 --> 00:06:13,660
你好
Hello.

154
00:06:13,660 --> 00:06:15,240
斯尔图特  我们得谈谈
Stuart, we have to talk.

155
