你跟我妈那点事儿
This thing with you and my mom,

156
00:06:18,350 --> 00:06:19,800
让我超不爽
I-I hate it.

157
00:06:19,800 --> 00:06:21,230
都快把我逼疯了
It's making me crazy.

158
00:06:21,230 --> 00:06:23,870
你我是多年的朋友了
You and I were friends for years,

159
00:06:23,870 --> 00:06:26,120
如今你却要带我妈去参加
and now you're bringing my mother to a party

160
00:06:26,120 --> 00:06:27,470
我也在场的舞会
I'm going to?!

161
00:06:27,470 --> 00:06:28,820
太离谱了吧
What the hell?!

162
00:06:28,820 --> 00:06:32,150
我没有要带你妈去啊  我有其他舞伴
I'm not bringing your mother, I have a date.

163
00:06:32,150 --> 00:06:35,170
所以你现在是背着我妈偷吃吗
Oh, so now you're cheating on my mother?

164
00:06:38,820 --> 00:06:40,180
你在胡说什么呀
Wha-What are you talking about?

165
00:06:40,180 --> 00:06:43,360
我和你妈之前完全不存在任何逾越之举
There's nothing weird going on with me and your mother.

166
00:06:43,360 --> 00:06:47,110
图仔  你的洗澡水要凉了哦
Stewie, your bath is getting cold!

167
00:06:48,580 --> 00:06:50,290
我得挂了  再见
I got to go, bye.

168
00:06:53,390 --> 00:06:54,050
佩妮
Penny?

169
00:06:54,530 --> 00:06:55,330
佩妮
Penny.

170
00:06:55,900 --> 00:06:56,640
佩妮
Penny.

171
00:06:57,120 --> 00:06:57,940
佩妮
Penny.

172
00:06:58,470 --> 00:06:59,560
佩妮
Penny.

173
00:07:00,310 --> 00:07:01,550
今天敲门的次数比平时多呀
You knocked more than usual.

174
00:07:01,550 --> 00:07:03,010
下次我可能有急事
Next time I might be in a rush,

175
00:07:03,010 --> 00:07:05,090
先多敲两下存着吧
it's good to have a few in the bank.

176
00:07:05,660 --> 00:07:06,650
找我干嘛
Okay, what's up?

177
00:07:06,650 --> 00:07:08,760
我想跟你讨论下
I'd like to discuss this party

178
00:07:08,760 --> 00:07:10,940
艾米和伯纳黛特举办的这个舞会
that Amy and Bernadette are throwing.

179
