Why would your mother have a problem with me and Stuart?

356
00:15:16,180 --> 00:15:19,390
因为他们之间存在着不恰当的逾越之举
'Cause they have a weird, inappropriate relationship.

357
00:15:19,390 --> 00:15:22,930
比咱俩在我爸车里"做"的事还逾越吗
Weirder than what you and I did in my dad's Corolla?

358
00:15:25,700 --> 00:15:27,260
真是太"糟糕"了
This is so messed up.

359
00:15:27,260 --> 00:15:29,700
我知道  我看得好开心啊
I know, I'm having the best time.

360
00:15:31,150 --> 00:15:32,900
你今天为什么要来
Why would you even come to this?

361
00:15:32,900 --> 00:15:34,590
你不是知道我也会在场吗
Didn't you know I'd be here?

362
00:15:34,590 --> 00:15:36,530
那事都过去多久了  霍华德
It was a long time ago, Howard.

363
00:15:36,530 --> 00:15:38,890
而且你俩是二等堂姐弟  有啥关系
And you're only second cousins, who cares?

364
00:15:36,530 --> 00:15:38,890
珍妮与霍华德关系为同房远堂
也就是外国人眼中二等堂(second cousin)

365
00:15:38,890 --> 00:15:41,360
你明知道这事还非要带她来吗
So, you knew and you brought her anyway?

366
00:15:41,360 --> 00:15:44,180
霍德华能上她  我却不能上吗
Oh, so she's good enough for Howard, but not for me?!

367
00:15:44,180 --> 00:15:44,770
没错
Yeah.

368
00:15:44,770 --> 00:15:46,230
滚回家和你自己妈妈
Yeah, go have weird relationships

369
00:15:46,230 --> 00:15:47,560
堂姐玩不伦去吧
with your own mother and cousin.

370
00:15:47,560 --> 00:15:48,440
这是他的地盘
This is his turf.

371
00:15:48,440 --> 00:15:49,930
说得对
Yeah.

372
00:15:53,300 --> 00:15:55,600
我当年可能不会邀请你跳舞
Well, I might not have asked you to dance then,

373
00:15:55,600 --> 00:15:58,460
-但让我现在邀请你吧  -可是没音乐啊
- but I will ask you now. - There's no music.

374
00:15:58,460 --> 00:15:59,430
我不管
I don't care.

375
00:15:59,430 --> 00:16:01,060
咱们自己制造音乐嘛
We'll make our own music.

376
00:16:01,060 --> 00:16:03,140
瞧瞧  现在谁像个傻瓜啊
My God, who's the dork now?

377
00:16:11,030 --> 00:16:13,200
谢谢你穿了平跟鞋
Thank you for wearing your flats.

378
00:16:13,200 --> 00:16:15,890
谢谢你穿了高跟鞋
Thank you for wearing your heels.

379
00:16:19,350 --> 00:16:20,810
看我多有出息
Look at me.

380
00:16:20,810 --> 00:16:24,030
和舞会中最美的姑娘一起跳舞
Dancing with the prettiest girl at the prom.

381
00:16:24,550 --> 00:16:25,890
想不想拍张合影发给
Want to take a picture of us and send it

382
00:16:25,890 --> 00:16:28,150
你国际象棋俱乐部的朋友啊
to your old friends in the chess club?

383
00:16:28,870 --> 00:16:31,910
我几年前就把你的泳装照发给他们了
I sent them a bikini shot of you years ago.

384
00:16:35,550 --> 00:16:37,120
这样真好
This is nice.

385
00:16:37,810 --> 00:16:39,840
我都有点希望其他人不来了
I kind of wish no one else was coming.

386
00:16:40,070 --> 00:16:42,110
我也这么想
I know, me, too.

387
00:16:43,020 --> 00:16:46,300
但能过个不混乱的毕业舞会也不错
But it will be fun to have a prom without all the drama.

388
00:16:49,210 --> 00:16:50,760
华仔  放开他
Howie, get off of him!

389
00:16:50,760 --> 00:16:54,520
除非这只猪不再专拱我家的白菜
Not until he stops humping his way up my family tree!

390
00:16:56,590 --> 00:16:58,510
谢尔顿  你太傻了
Sheldon, this is silly.

391
00:16:58,510 --> 00:17:00,050
我不要又错过一次舞会
I'm not missing another prom.

392
00:17:00,050 --> 00:17:01,250
我要上楼去了
I'm going upstairs now.

393
00:17:01,250 --> 00:17:02,670
回见
Good-bye.

394
00:17:03,680 --> 00:17:06,250
我真心觉得你今天很美
I really did think you looked pretty.

395
00:17:06,710 --> 00:17:07,920
真的吗
You did?

396
00:17:08,370 --> 00:17:09,290
真的
Yes.

397
00:17:10,080 --> 00:17:12,800
惊艳到让我开始恐慌
So much so that I started to panic.

398
00:17:12,800 --> 00:17:14,630
你不用紧张
Well, you can relax.

399
00:17:15,320 --> 00:17:17,280
就算你觉得我很美
Just because you think I look pretty

400
00:17:17,740 --> 00:17:21,040
也不代表我们今晚就要在一起
doesn't mean we have to spend the night together.

401
00:17:21,750 --> 00:17:24,230
可这是舞会  你不就想这样吗
Were you hoping we would because it's prom?

402
00:17:24,230 --> 00:17:26,540
我一直都想
I'm always hoping.

403
00:17:27,570 --> 00:17:31,610
但今晚我只想好好和你享受舞会
But tonight I just wanted to have a nice time with you.

404
00:17:32,030 --> 00:17:35,700
或许还能跟有手臂的生物跳舞
And maybe dance with someone who has arms.

405
00:17:37,030 --> 00:17:38,950
谢谢你理解我
Thank you for understanding.

406
00:17:38,950 --> 00:17:41,220
我当然理解
Of course I understand.

407
00:17:43,350 --> 00:17:44,730
谢尔顿
Sheldon,

408
00:17:46,040 --> 00:17:47,860
有些话我一直想告诉你
there's something else I've been wanting to say,

409
00:17:47,860 --> 00:17:49,580
在说之前  我...
but before I do, I just...

410
00:17:50,740 --> 00:17:53,320
我想让你明白  你不用回复我
I want you to know that you don't have to say it back.

411
00:17:53,320 --> 00:17:54,580
我知道你还没准备好
I know you're not ready,

412
00:17:54,580 --> 00:17:56,500
所以我不希望你
and I don't want you to say it

413
00:17:56,500 --> 00:17:58,360
仅仅因为社交规矩而说出来
just because social convention dictates...

414
00:17:58,360 --> 00:18:00,110
我也爱你
I love you, too.

415
00:18:04,670 --> 00:18:06,300
你说出来了
You said it.

416
00:18:06,790 --> 00:18:08,630
我对你有着不可否认
There's no denying I have feelings for you

417
00:18:08,630 --> 00:18:11,220
又无法用其他途径解释的好感
that can't be explained in any other way.

418
00:18:12,260 --> 00:18:16,040
我曾以为自己脑子里长了寄生虫
I briefly considered that I had a brain parasite.

419
00:18:18,560 --> 00:18:20,690
但那个理由更牵强
But that seems even more farfetched.

420
00:18:24,150 --> 00:18:26,520
唯一的结论  这就是爱
The only conclusion was love.

421
00:18:30,630 --> 00:18:32,420
我知道你怎么了
I know what's happening.

422
00:18:33,930 --> 00:18:35,630
你这是恐慌发作
This is a panic attack.

423
00:18:35,630 --> 00:18:38,300
"足球妈妈09"说要双腿抬高马上躺下
SoccerMom09 says to lie down with your feet elevated.

424
00:18:38,300 --> 00:18:39,680
好的
Okay.

425
00:18:41,240 --> 00:18:42,640
虽然我说了我爱你
Just because I love you doesn't mean

426
00:18:42,640 --> 00:18:44,950
但不代表女生可以进我房间啊
girls are allowed in my room.

427
00:18:56,690 --> 00:18:58,120
好了
Okay.

428
00:18:58,120 --> 00:19:00,300
照相啦
Here we go...

429
00:19:00,300 --> 00:19:02,300
说"茄子"
Say "Cheese"!

430
00:19:05,190 --> 00:19:07,040
说"田七"
Say "Cheese"!

431
00:19:10,500 --> 00:19:13,080
说"堂姐"
Say "Cousin"!

432
00:19:16,380 --> 00:19:17,210
说
Say...

433
00:19:17,860 --> 00:19:19,110
抱歉
Oh, sorry.

434
00:19:19,110 --> 00:19:21,050
等一下  抱歉
Hang on, sorry.

435
00:19:23,110 --> 00:19:24,560
黛比
Hey, Debbie.

436
00:19:25,070 --> 00:19:27,480
我...是的  我和珍妮在一起
I... Yeah, yeah, I'm here with Jeanie.

437
00:19:28,050 --> 00:19:30,290
可我和她只是朋友
Okay, but we're just friends.

438
00:19:30,290 --> 00:19:32,400
只是...  好吧
It's... Yeah.

439
00:19:32,560 --> 00:19:33,680
我得赶紧走了
I got to go.

